course: dictionary
lesson: 4959
title: One word, many meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning, and the context shows you which one the writer means. Incarnation is one of these words. In a church lesson it means something very different from «the latest incarnation of the phone».
explain: Look at the words around it. «The Incarnation» has a capital letter and names a special Christian belief about Jesus, so it is about religion. «In a past incarnation» means an earlier form or life of someone, so it is about change over time.
explain: Read the sentence, then the sentences before and after it. Ask what the writer is trying to tell you, then check that your meaning fits the sentence.
fact: An incarnation is a form that a being or a quality takes, a shape or life in which it appears.
fact: «The Incarnation» is the Christian belief that God the Son became a real human being, Jesus, born of Mary.
fact: In Hinduism, an avatar is an incarnation: a form in which a god appears on earth, such as Krishna as an incarnation of Vishnu.
fact: «She is the incarnation of kindness» means she shows kindness perfectly, in one person.
fact: At Christmas, Christians remember that in Jesus God came close to ordinary people, «Emmanuel, God with us».
exercise: «She is the incarnation of kindness.» What does incarnation mean here? | A cold winter storm | A slow, sleepy animal | *A perfect example of a quality, shown in one person | A type of church bell
exercise: «The latest incarnation of the phone» means what? | A phone that has been lost | *A newer version or form of the phone | A phone made of stone | A phone that rings in church
exercise: Which lesson would be most likely to talk about the Incarnation? | *A religion lesson at Christmas | A music lesson about drums | A maths lesson about shapes | A PE lesson about running
test: In Hinduism, what is an avatar? | A kind of musical instrument | A festival of lights | A type of dance | *A form in which a god appears on earth
test: «Christians believe that in Jesus God himself became a human being.» What is this belief called? | The school play | The winter fair | *The Incarnation | The Easter egg hunt
exam: In the phrase «in a past incarnation», what does the word most likely suggest? | A sunny day at the beach | A broken clock | A new car | *An earlier life or form of someone
